<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Ax1.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In Appendix A: Full metric tables ‣ PTPP-Aware Adaptation Scaling Laws:Predicting Domain-Adaptation Performance at Unseen Pre-Training Budgets" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">French — Unseen <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathit{P}\mathrm{\textsc{tpp}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">tpp</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathit{P}\mathrm{\textsc{tpp}}</annotation></semantics></math>=279, with 241M anchors.</span></a></li>
