<section id="Ax2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix">Appendix B: Oracle baseline</h2>

<div id="Ax2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For reference, a <em id="Ax2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="Ax2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathit{P}\mathrm{\textsc{tpp}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">tpp</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathit{P}\mathrm{\textsc{tpp}}</annotation></semantics></math>-wise oracle</em> that fits <span id="Ax2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath">D</span><span id="Ax2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath">-</span><span id="Ax2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_smallcaps">cpt</span> directly on <math id="Ax2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathit{P}\mathrm{\textsc{tpp}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">tpp</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathit{P}\mathrm{\textsc{tpp}}</annotation></semantics></math>=279 and evaluates on the same:</p>
<table id="Ax2.p1.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
