<p id="Ax2.p1.3" class="ltx_p">The Oracle uses full <math id="Ax2.p1.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathit{P}\mathrm{\textsc{tpp}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">tpp</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathit{P}\mathrm{\textsc{tpp}}</annotation></semantics></math>=279 supervision and serves only as an upper bound.</p>
